{
  "id": "LEV.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Abalawi 15",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eubi ekorua ase omobere o Mwanyabaanto ekomokora abe oyotachenegeti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa na Aroni, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwana n’Abaisraeli, mobateebie ng’a onye omonto omosacha okorua amaache anga buna chimengere korwa ase ekiimo kiaye ki’obosacha, amaache ayio neubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro achiikire ase amang’ana ayio: Amaache ayio karagenderere korua, gose atigire korua, omonto oyio tachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebirarero bionsi araararere, gose araikaransere, nigo biraabe ebitachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde bwensi aise gokuna ebiraarero bi’omonto oyio goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi oraikaransere egento omonto oria omorwaire aikaranserete, goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi orakune omonto oyio omorwaire goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio omorwaire karatwere omonto ochenegete amate, nere goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, naende abe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egeikaransero gekobekerwa eng’iti ekoriinwa, gokeraikaranserwe nomonto oria omorwaire, nakebe egetachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto aise gokuna egento kende gionsi kiareenge inse y’omonto oria omorwaire nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio; na onde bwensi oraimokie egento buna ekio nigo arasibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto oria omorwaire ogokuna omonto onde ataraisaba amaboko, oria okunwa goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache naende nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyongo ende yonsi omonto oria omorwaire arakune goika yaatwe, na egekorero kende gionsi keroiseirie omote arakune goika gesibigwe namaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto oria gachenekire korwa ase okorua kw’amaache aria anga buna achimengere goika abare amatuko atano na abere ay’ogocheneka kwaye. Erio asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache amaya a rooche, ere nabe oyochenegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na gatato aire amaruma abere, gose amage ’amaruma abere, ase obosio bwane inche Omonene agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano, ayae Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani arue erimo ribe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na erinde ribe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa. Ase enchera eyio akore okobwatanigwa ase omonto oria ase obosio bwane, ase engencho y’okorua kwaye kw’amaache anga buna chimengere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto omosacha ogosokia embusuro yaye y’oroiboro, rirorio esibie omobere namaache, na agenderere koba oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eanga ende yonsi, na ebinto binde bionsi bi’amasankwa, embusuro eyio y’oroiboro eratonyere, goika bisibigwe namaache, nabirobio nabibe ebitachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onye orarire n’omokuungu, na omobekeire embusuro y’oroiboro, bonsi babere goika besibie emebere yabo namaache, nabarabwo nababe abatachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero omokungu are nomotienyi nigo arabe oyotachenegeti ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere. Onde bwensi oramokune nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gento kende gionsi arabe okoraarera ekero are nomotienyi, nigo keraabe egetachenegeti, boigo n’ebinto bionsi araikaransere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde bwensi orakune ebiraarero bi’omokuungu oyio goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi orakune egento omokungu oyio aikaranserete, nigo arasibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache; ere nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo kobiraabe ebiraarero, gose egento omokungu oria aikaranserete, omonto karabikune nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosacha karaarare n’omokuungu ore nomotienyi, ogotacheneka kw’omokuungu oyio nakobe asare, ere nabe oyotachenegeti ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, na gento kende gionsi araararere nakebe egetachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omokungu karagenderere goiteka amanyinga ase amatuko amange atari ay’omotienyi oye, gose ayagoiteka goetania amatuko aye ay’omotienyi, nigo arabe oyotachenegeti ase engaki eyio yonsi arabe ogoiteka amanyinga; nabe oyotachenegeti buna ekero are nomotienyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiraarero bionsi are koraarera ekero agoiteka amanyinga, nigo biraabe ebitachenegeti buna ebi akoraarera ekero are nomotienyi, naboigo na kende gionsi araikaransere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi orakune ebinto ebio nabe oyotachenegeti; ere asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache, naende nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ogoiteka kwaye kw’amanyinga gwakamire, abare amatuko atano na abere, erio nabe ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na gatato aire amaruma abere gose amage ’amaruma abere ase Omokuani agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani arue erimo ribe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na erinde eki’ogosaambwa. Ase enchera eyio nakore okobwatanigwa ase omokungu oria ase obosio bwane, ase engencho y’ogotacheneka kwaye kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase enchera eyio okuurere Abaisraeli igoro y’ogotacheneka kwabo, tibaabaisa kogera Obomenyo bwane Obochenu bore ase egati yabo bobe obotachenegeti. Baise gokora bo, nigo barakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
